      "name": "a prose body adds no address: both readings see the same set",
      "geml": "=== meta\nprofile = \"geml-media/v1\"\n===\n\n=== media-text {#look .look}\nTwenty-six, **silver bob**, an old scar.\n===\n",
      "addresses": {
